# ---- 密钥与凭据（绝不可提交）----
# ---- Keys and credentials (never commit) ----
tunnel_key
tunnel_key.pub
host_key
host_key.pub
known_hosts
authorized_keys
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
config.json

# ---- 运行时生成的配置与日志 ----
# ---- Runtime configuration and logs ----
# 注意 config.json 前的 /：只忽略仓库根目录下的那份，
# 不影响将来可能出现的 testdata/config.json 之类。
# The leading slash ignores only the repository-root config.json, not a future
# file such as testdata/config.json.
/config.json
tunnelx.log
tunnelx.log.*
startup.log
audit.jsonl
.tunnelx-control.json
.tunnelx-ui.json
.codex-tmp/

# ---- 构建产物 ----
# ---- Build artifacts ----
# 全部以 / 开头限定在仓库根：否则 "tunnel-server" 会连同
# cmd/tunnel-server/ 这个源码目录一起被忽略。
# Leading slashes scope these names to the repository root; otherwise the
# tunnel-server pattern would also hide the cmd/tunnel-server source directory.
/tunnelx
/tunnelx.exe
/tunnelx-cli
/tunnelx-cli.exe
/tunnelx-cli-linux-*
/tunnel-server
/tunnel-server.exe
/tunnel-server-linux-*
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/dist/
/build/

# ---- 本地资料（不公开）----
# ---- Local material (not published) ----
/docs/
/AGENTS.md

# ---- Go ----
# ---- Go ----
*.test
*.out
vendor/

# ---- 调试产物 ----
# ---- Debug artifacts ----
# Delve（dlv debug / VSCode 调试）在被调试包目录下生成的临时二进制。
# Temporary binaries created by Delve (dlv debug / VS Code) in package directories.
__debug_bin*
*.exe~

# ---- 编辑器 / 系统 ----
# ---- Editors / operating system ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
